    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如下圖所示，一重量為 <strong>$W$</strong> 的物體，置於斜角為 <strong>$\\theta$</strong> 的光滑斜面上，回答下列問題：\n        </p>\n\n<div class=\"sub-question\" id=\"part1\">\n<div class=\"sub-title\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">1</span>\n            問題 (1)：沿斜面向上施力使物體平衡時，斜面施於物的作用力為何？\n          </div>\n<div class=\"option-grid\">\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" data-opt=\"A\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">A</span>\n<span>$W \\cos\\theta$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"B\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">B</span>\n<span>$W \\sin\\theta$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"C\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">C</span>\n<span>$W$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"D\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">D</span>\n<span>$\\dfrac{W}{\\cos\\theta}$</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feedback-msg\" id=\"msg1\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px; font-size:0.92rem;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-question\" id=\"part2\">\n<div class=\"sub-title\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">2</span>\n            問題 (2)：沿水平方向施力使物體平衡時，斜面施於物的作用力為何？\n          </div>\n<div class=\"option-grid\">\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"A\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">A</span>\n<span>$W \\cos\\theta$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"B\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">B</span>\n<span>$W \\tan\\theta$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" data-opt=\"C\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">C</span>\n<span>$\\dfrac{W}{\\cos\\theta}$（即 $W \\sec\\theta$）</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"D\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">D</span>\n<span>$W (1 + \\sin\\theta)$</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feedback-msg\" id=\"msg2\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px; font-size:0.92rem;\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
