        "label": "📐 原始題圖 (斜坡上兩人抬木棒)",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"220\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#facc15\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">甲</text>\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-yellow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"165\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">F_甲 (鉛直向上)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"150\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00e676\"/>\n  <text x=\"395\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">乙</text>\n  <line x1=\"380\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-green)\"/>\n  <text x=\"385\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">F_乙 (鉛直向上)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"185\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ff5252\"/>\n  <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"265\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">mg (系統總重)</text>\n</svg>"
