        "label": "📐 原始題圖 (梯子防滑拉繩極限)",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"260\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#64748b\"/>\n  <text x=\"145\" y=\"275\" fill=\"#64748b\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">B (牆角)</text>\n  <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"47\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"260\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#facc15\"/>\n  <text x=\"330\" y=\"275\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">A (底端)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"47\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00e5ff\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"45\" fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">C (頂端)</text>\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">53°</text>\n  <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"280\" fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">水平細繩 (張力 T ≤ 11 kgw)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"153.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ff5252\"/>\n  <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"153.5\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"215\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"248\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"11.5\">梯重 12</text>\n  <circle cx=\"267\" cy=\"189\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fbbf24\"/>\n  <line x1=\"267\" y1=\"189\" x2=\"267\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-yellow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"275\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"11.5\">🐒 猴重 10</text>\n</svg>"
