        "label": "📐 原始題圖 (均質棒斜倚垂直壁)",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"240\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#facc15\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text>\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#facc15\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"65\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text>\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"120\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#00e5ff\"/>\n  <text x=\"325\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text>\n  <text x=\"175\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">α</text>\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"12\">繩張力 T</text>\n  <circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"180\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ff5252\"/>\n  <text x=\"245\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"11\">E (重心)</text>\n  <line x1=\"235\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"235\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"245\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">W</text>\n</svg>"
