        "label": "📐 原始輪軸與加速受力題意圖",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"120\" r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"120\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#facc15\"/>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">O (軸心)</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"32\" fill=\"#64748b\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">外輪 (R)</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">內軸 (r = ½R)</text>\n  <line x1=\"350\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-green)\"/>\n  <text x=\"360\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">施力 F</text>\n  <line x1=\"230\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"215\" y=\"200\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"230\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">m</text>\n  <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"185\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-yellow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">a = 0.2g ↑</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"280\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">張力 T - mg = m(0.2g) ⟹ T = 1.2mg ⟹ τ = T · r = 0.6mgR</text>\n</svg>"
