        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path d=\"M70,260 l-10,12 M130,260 l-10,12 M190,260 l-10,12 M250,260 l-10,12 M310,260 l-10,12 M370,260 l-10,12 M430,260 l-10,12\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"180\" y=\"190\" width=\"180\" height=\"70\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"232\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text>\n  <rect x=\"220\" y=\"130\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">m</text>\n  <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"440\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text>\n  <text x=\"330\" y=\"185\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">μ₁ (層間摩擦)</text>\n  <text x=\"370\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">μ₂ (地面摩擦)</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M 保持不動條件：f₁ &lt; f₂ ⟹ μ₁/μ₂ &lt; (M+m)/m</text>\n</svg>"
