        "label": "📐 連接體滑輪受力原圖",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"180\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#475569\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"180\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/>\n  <rect x=\"220\" y=\"170\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"295\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B (10 kg)</text>\n  <rect x=\"240\" y=\"135\" width=\"90\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"285\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A (2 kg)</text>\n  <line x1=\"470\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <line x1=\"470\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"435\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"152\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#475569\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"152\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/>\n  <line x1=\"330\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"435\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"435\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"185\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"66\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"48\" y=\"245\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"66\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C</text>\n  <text x=\"295\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">f_地 = 4.8 kgw ＋ f_AB = 0.4 kgw ＋ T_A = 0.4 kgw = 5.6 kgw</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">拉動臨界條件：W_C = 4.8 + 0.4 + 0.4 = 5.6 kgw</text>\n</svg>"
