    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            如附圖所示，一均勻的繩子跨置於水平平臺與傾角 $37^\\circ$ 的斜面交界處。當其總長度的 $\\frac{1}{3}$ 停於水平平臺上（其餘 $\\frac{2}{3}$ 垂於斜面上）時，繩子恰可向下滑動。設平臺與斜面的摩擦係數均相同為 $\\mu$，則此摩擦係數為多少？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) $\\frac{6}{13}$",
      "(B) $\\frac{12}{17}$",
      "(C) $\\frac{2}{5}$",
      "(D) $\\frac{3}{5}$",
      "(E) $\\frac{4}{5}$"
    ],
    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <polygon points=\"50,110 180,110 400,275 50,275\" fill=\"rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.4)\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path d=\"M350,275 A50,50 0 0,1 361,245\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"325\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">37°</text>\n  <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"326\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">⅓ 繩長 (平臺)</text>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">⅔ 繩長 (斜面)</text>\n  <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"310\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">下滑力 ⅖ mg</text>\n  <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-green)\"/>\n  <text x=\"195\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">f₁=⁸/₁₅ μmg</text>\n  <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-green)\"/>\n  <text x=\"75\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">f₂=⅓ μmg</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">臨界自滑條件：⅖ mg = μ(⁸/₁₅ + ⁵/₁₅)mg ⟹ μ = 6/13</text>\n</svg>",
    "diagrams": [
      {
        "label": "📐 跨越平臺與斜面均勻繩原圖",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <polygon points=\"50,110 180,110 400,275 50,275\" fill=\"rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.4)\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path d=\"M350,275 A50,50 0 0,1 361,245\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"325\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">37°</text>\n  <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"326\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">⅓ 繩長 (平臺)</text>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">⅔ 繩長 (斜面)</text>\n  <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"310\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">下滑力 ⅖ mg</text>\n  <line x1=\"253\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"132\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-green)\"/>\n  <text x=\"195\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">f₁=⁸/₁₅ μmg</text>\n  <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-green)\"/>\n  <text x=\"75\" y=\"125\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">f₂=⅓ μmg</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">臨界自滑條件：⅖ mg = μ(⁸/₁₅ + ⁵/₁₅)mg ⟹ μ = 6/13</text>\n</svg>"
      },
      {
        "label": "💡 柔性繩分段受力與滑動臨界方程",
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"15\" width=\"500\" height=\"290\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85)\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"42\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">💡 柔性繩分段受力與滑動臨界方程：</text>\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. 設繩總質量為 m，斜面傾角 37°（sin 37° = ⅗, cos 37° = ⅘）：</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"92\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-size=\"11.8\">斜面上 ⅔ 繩長之重力沿斜面向下滑動力：</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"112\" fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">F_下 = (⅔ m) g sin 37° = (⅔)(⅗) mg = ⅖ mg</text>\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"142\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. 計算兩段接觸面之最大靜摩擦阻力：</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-size=\"12\">・斜面段摩擦力：f₁ = μ (⅔ m) g cos 37° = (⁸/₁₅) μmg</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">・平臺段摩擦力：f₂ = μ (⅓ m) g = (⁵/₁₅) μmg</text>\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"218\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. 恰可滑動之臨界平衡條件：</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"240\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-size=\"12\">F_下 = f₁ + f₂ ⟹ ⅖ = (¹³/₁₅) μ ⟹ ⁶/₁₅ = (¹³/₁₅) μ</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"bold\">⚡ μ = 6/13  ✅ (A)</text>\n</svg>"
      }
    ],
