    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            將重量為 $W$ 的物體置放於一粗糙斜面上，已知物體與粗糙斜面間靜摩擦係數為 $\\mu_s$，物體與粗糙斜面間動摩擦係數為 $\\mu_k$，將斜面的斜角 $\\theta$ 由零度漸漸增加到 $\\theta_0$，但物體仍未沿斜面下滑，則在此過程中，下列敘述何者正確？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) 斜面對物體的靜摩擦力不變",
      "(B) 斜面對物體的靜摩擦力漸減",
      "(C) 斜面對物體接觸面垂直的正向力漸增",
      "(D) 斜面對物體的作用力為 $W$",
      "(E) 「斜面對物體的作用力」和「物體所受重力」互為作用力與反作用力"
    ],
    "svg": "<svg style=\"max-width: 500px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<!-- Ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"500\" y1=\"240\" y2=\"240\"></line>\n<path d=\"M50 240 l-10 12 M80 240 l-10 12 M110 240 l-10 12 M140 240 l-10 12 M170 240 l-10 12 M200 240 l-10 12 M230 240 l-10 12 M260 240 l-10 12 M290 240 l-10 12 M320 240 l-10 12 M350 240 l-10 12 M380 240 l-10 12 M410 240 l-10 12 M440 240 l-10 12 M470 240 l-10 12\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Incline: base from (460,240) to (140,240), height (140,110), inclined down-right ~ 22 deg -->\n<polygon fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.75)\" points=\"140,110 140,240 460,240\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></polygon>\n<!-- Angle theta at right corner (460, 240) -->\n<path d=\"M 410 240 A 50 50 0 0 1 418 219\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"390\" y=\"233\">θ</text>\n<!-- Block on Incline: center at (280, 167), slope angle 22 deg down-right -->\n<g transform=\"translate(280, 167) rotate(22.1)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3)\" height=\"45\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" width=\"70\" x=\"-35\" y=\"-45\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"-8\" y=\"-18\">W</text>\n<!-- Normal force N: perpendicular upwards -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan-20)\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"-22.5\" y2=\"-75\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"6\" y=\"-60\">N = W cosθ</text>\n<!-- Static friction f: up-slope (pointing left in rotated frame) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green-20)\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"-45\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"0\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"-48\" y=\"15\">f = W sinθ</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Gravity W: from center (280, 150) straight down -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red-20)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"280\" x2=\"280\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"230\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"290\" y=\"210\">W (重力)</text>\n<!-- Resultant Contact Force R: from center (280, 150) straight up! -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-yellow-20)\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"280\" x2=\"280\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"60\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"290\" y=\"80\">R = N + f = W (鉛直向上)</text>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-cyan-20\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#00e5ff\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green-20\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#00e676\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red-20\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#ef4444\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-yellow-20\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#facc15\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n</svg>",
