        "svg": "<svg style=\"max-width: 500px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<!-- Ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<path d=\"M90 260 l-10 12 M120 260 l-10 12 M150 260 l-10 12 M180 260 l-10 12 M210 260 l-10 12 M240 260 l-10 12 M270 260 l-10 12 M300 260 l-10 12 M330 260 l-10 12 M360 260 l-10 12 M390 260 l-10 12 M420 260 l-10 12 M450 260 l-10 12\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Wall on Right: at x=380 from y=50 to 260 -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"380\" x2=\"380\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<path d=\"M380 60 l12 -10 M380 90 l12 -10 M380 120 l12 -10 M380 150 l12 -10 M380 180 l12 -10 M380 210 l12 -10 M380 240 l12 -10\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Cylinder: radius R = 90. Touching ground at y=260, touching wall at x=380.\n                 Center O: (380 - 90 = 290, 260 - 90 = 170) -->\n<circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"170\" fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.75)\" r=\"90\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n<!-- Center O -->\n<circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"170\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"300\" y=\"175\">O</text>\n<!-- Radius dashed line R -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"226\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"106\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"245\" y=\"145\">R</text>\n<!-- Force f (horizontal push along radius to O): from x=140 to x=200 at y=170 -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red-21)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"130\" x2=\"198\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"170\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"115\" y=\"175\">f</text>\n<!-- Vertical Force F (applied at (200, 170) pointing UP) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-yellow-21)\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"200\" x2=\"200\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"70\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"208\" y=\"75\">F</text>\n<!-- Gravity W: from O (290, 170) pointing DOWN -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple-21)\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"290\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#a855f7\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"300\" y=\"275\">W</text>\n<!-- Wall Normal N (pointing left from 380, 170 to 320, 170) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan-21)\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"380\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"170\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"340\" y=\"160\">N</text>\n<!-- Ground Normal N1 (from 290, 260 pointing up) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan-21)\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"290\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"215\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e5ff\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"265\" y=\"235\">N₁</text>\n<!-- Wall friction f1 (downwards or upwards) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green-21)\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"380\" x2=\"380\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"220\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"388\" y=\"210\">f₁</text>\n<!-- Ground friction f2 (leftwards or rightwards) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green-21)\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"245\" y=\"280\">f₂</text>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red-21\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#ef4444\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-yellow-21\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#facc15\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-purple-21\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#a855f7\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-cyan-21\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#00e5ff\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green-21\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#00e676\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n</svg>"
