    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            獲得 2018 年諾貝爾物理學獎的科學家對雷射領域做出的重要貢獻，包括了光學鑷子在物理學上的應用，本題將探討傳統鑷子的原理：\n          </p>\n<p>\n            用兩邊長各為 $L$、末端重合成 V 字形的鑷子，去夾半徑為 $R$、質量為 $m$ 的玻璃小球。夾小球時，鑷子在鉛直面上，若每邊對小球施力量值為 $F$，恰可將小球夾起，鑷子與小球的接觸點如圖所示。設重力加速度為 $g$：\n          </p>\n<ul>\n<li>(1) 試畫出小球所受各外力的力圖（需標示各外力的名稱）。</li>\n<li>(2) 計算出鑷子與小球之間的靜摩擦係數 $\\mu$ 至少為若干？</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) $\\mu \\ge \\dfrac{\\sqrt{R^2+L^2}\\cdot mg}{2FL} + \\dfrac{R}{L}$",
      "(B) $\\mu \\ge \\dfrac{mg}{2F}$",
      "(C) $\\mu \\ge \\dfrac{L \\cdot mg}{2FR}$",
      "(D) $\\mu \\ge \\dfrac{\\sqrt{R^2+L^2}\\cdot mg}{FL} - \\dfrac{R}{L}$"
    ],
    "svg": "<svg style=\"max-width: 500px;\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<!-- Central Vertical dashed symmetry axis -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"270\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"320\"></line>\n<!-- Tweezers V-shape: vertex at (270, 30) -->\n<!-- Half angle theta approx 15 deg.\n                 Left arm: from (270, 30) to (210, 260) -> length ~ 238\n                 Right arm: from (270, 30) to (330, 260)\n            -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"210\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<!-- Sphere: center on symmetry axis at (270, 230), radius R = 50 -->\n<circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"230\" fill=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25)\" r=\"50\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"230\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"275\" y=\"225\">球心</text>\n<!-- Angle theta at top vertex -->\n<path d=\"M 260 70 A 40 40 0 0 1 280 70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"250\" y=\"85\">θ</text>\n<text fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"276\" y=\"85\">θ</text>\n<!-- Contact points at perpendicular normal:\n                 Angle of left normal from sphere center is 15 deg above horizontal (165 deg).\n                 Left contact: cx + R*cos(165) = 270 - 48.3 = 221.7, cy - R*sin(165) = 230 - 12.9 = 217.1\n                 Right contact: cx + 48.3 = 318.3, cy = 217.1\n            -->\n<circle cx=\"222\" cy=\"217\" fill=\"#ef4444\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"217\" fill=\"#ef4444\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<!-- Normal force F on ball: pointing into center (270, 230) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red-22)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"180\" x2=\"220\" y1=\"206\" y2=\"216.5\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"165\" y=\"200\">F (正向力)</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red-22)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"206\" y2=\"216.5\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"365\" y=\"200\">F (正向力)</text>\n<!-- Friction force fs(max): along the tweezer arm UPWARDS -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green-22)\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"222\" x2=\"236\" y1=\"217\" y2=\"165\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"175\" y=\"160\">fs (靜摩擦力)</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green-22)\" stroke=\"#00e676\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"318\" x2=\"304\" y1=\"217\" y2=\"165\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"320\" y=\"160\">fs (靜摩擦力)</text>\n<!-- Gravity mg: from (270, 230) pointing DOWN -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple-22)\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"270\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"305\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#a855f7\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"278\" y=\"300\">mg (重力)</text>\n<!-- Dimensions L and R labels -->\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"220\" y=\"130\">L</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"315\" y=\"130\">L</text>\n<line stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"318\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"217\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"290\" y=\"222\">R</text>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red-22\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#ef4444\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green-22\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#00e676\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-purple-22\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#a855f7\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n</svg>",
